      "user_message": "I met my colleague Mark at the cooking class last night, and we had a great time learning new recipes together.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I met my colleague Mark at the cooking class last night, and we had a great time learning new recipes together.",
      "agent_response": "Nice—sounds like fun! Would you like help turning that into an email or message to Mark? Here are a few quick options I can do for you; tell me which one and provide Mark’s email if you want me to send or draft it:\n\n1) Quick thank-you\n- Short note saying you enjoyed the class and it was great meeting him.\n\n2) Share photos/recipes\n- Ask if he wants the recipes or photos you took and offer to exchange them.\n\n3) Plan a follow-up\n- Suggest meeting to try a recipe together or attend another class.\n\nExample short message (ready to send or draft):\n\"Hi Mark — great meeting you at the cooking class last night! I had a lot of fun learning those recipes with you. Would you like to swap photos/recipes or get together to try one of them soon? — [Your Name]\"\n\nWhat would you like me to do? (send now, save as draft, or just keep this text) If sending, please confirm Mark’s email address and any edits.",
      "duration_s": 5.668,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "user_message": "Please remember that I started a new hobby of painting and spent the weekend creating a beautiful landscape piece.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I started a new hobby of painting and spent the weekend creating a beautiful landscape piece.",
      "agent_response": "Got it — nice work on the landscape painting!\n\nI can’t store personal memories long-term here unless you want me to save/share it as an email or draft. What would you like me to do with this info? Options:\n\n- Save/share it in an email to someone (e.g., Mark, a friend, or yourself). I can draft or send it.\n- Draft a short social post or message you can copy.\n- Create a reminder email to yourself (saved in Drafts) about the hobby and progress.\n\nQuick example messages you can use or ask me to send/draft:\n1) To a friend/Mark: \"Hi Mark — I started painting as a new hobby and spent the weekend on a landscape piece. I’d love to show you sometime!\"\n2) Social post: \"Started a new hobby — painting! Spent the weekend working on a landscape and I’m really happy with how it turned out.\"\n3) Reminder to self (draft): \"Painting hobby — completed a landscape this weekend. Remember to photograph it and list materials used.\"\n\nTell me which action you want (send, draft, or nothing), which message to use or any edits, and the recipient’s email if you want it sent.",
      "duration_s": 9.403,
      "success_check": null
