      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: I enjoyed catching up with my old college friend, Rachel, over brunch at a cozy cafe downtown this morning.",
      "agent_response": "Nice — sounds like a lovely morning!\n\nI can help with any of the following — tell me which you want and provide Rachel’s email if you want me to send something:\n\nOptions:\n- Send a quick thank-you/follow-up to Rachel now (need her email).\n- Save a draft to yourself summarizing the catch-up (keeps a note of topics/actions).\n- Draft a message to plan the next meet-up or share photos/recipes from brunch.\n- Create a short social post you can copy/share.\n\nExample messages you can pick or edit:\n1) To Rachel (friendly follow-up):\n\"Hi Rachel — it was so nice catching up over brunch this morning! I loved hearing about what you’ve been up to. Want to do it again soon? — [Your Name]\"\n\n2) To plan next meet-up / share photos:\n\"Hey Rachel — great seeing you today! I took a few photos of the cafe — want me to send them? Also, are you free next Saturday to meet up again?\"\n\n3) Note to self (draft):\n\"Caught up with Rachel over brunch at the cozy downtown cafe this morning. Topics: [list any topics]. Follow-up: [actions].\"\n\n4) Social post:\n\"Caught up with my college friend Rachel over brunch at a cozy cafe this morning — such a great catch-up!\"\n\nWhich would you like me to do? If sending, please confirm Rachel’s email, any edits, and whether to send now or save as a draft.",
