      "agent_response": "Nice — sounds like a lovely catch-up with Sarah.\n\nI can’t store this as a long‑term memory here, but I can save or share it for you. Which would you like me to do?\n\nOptions (pick one and give any details or Sarah’s email if you want something sent):\n- Save a note to yourself (create a draft email to you) summarizing the virtual coffee and any action items.\n- Send or draft a follow-up message to Sarah (need her email). I can send now or save as a draft.\n- Draft a short social post you can copy.\n- Create a brief checklist email (saved as a draft) of any follow-ups you want to remember.\n\nExample messages you can use or edit:\n1) To Sarah (friendly follow-up):\n\"Hi Sarah — it was so nice catching up over virtual coffee yesterday! I loved hearing the family updates. Let’s do this again soon — when are you free next month? — [Your Name]\"\n\n2) Note to self (draft):\n\"Virtual coffee with cousin Sarah — shared family updates. Follow-ups: [list any actions].\"\n\n3) Social post:\n\"Caught up with my cousin Sarah over virtual coffee yesterday — loved hearing about our families!\"\n\nWhich would you like me to do, and do you want any edits or to send now (if sending, please provide Sarah’s email)?",
